  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Line a baking sheet with the aluminum foil sheet",
    "Place the cod fish in the center of the foil sheet",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the fish",
    "Sprinkle the minced garlic, grated ginger, paprika, salt, and black pepper over the fish",
    "Pour the lemon juice over the fish",
    "Fold the foil over the fish to create a papillote",
    "Place the baking sheet in the oven and bake for 12 minutes",
    "Remove the baking sheet from the oven and sprinkle the chopped parsley over the fish",
    "Serve the fish hot, straight from the papillote"
